Reading a scroll of fire while standing on a polymorph trap has a 1/3
chance of changing your character class, but you have no control over
what class you're changing into (and this destroys the trap, so can't
keep trying until you get the class you want).

#invoking a *blessed* bag of tricks has a 1/3 chance of:
	*  changing your character class, to your choice
	*  level teleporting you to the level of your choice
	*  polymorphing you into the monster of your choice

#invoking an *uncursed* bag of tricks:
	*  changing your character class, at random
	*  level teleporting you to a level at random
	*  polymorphing you into a monster at random

#invoking a *cursed* bag of tricks:
	*  changing your character class to Tourist
	*  level teleporting you to level 50
	*  polymorphing you into a newt


